e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vLkCL5lu0MoQ7kNvwEEG4sU&_nc_oc=AdqlptEITSn-ZQWG_6iEKDIOkQ_TSdI0HPtYj2teBhiMMY033KpJWPZDcw4Ehp-g9ZY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9TFUvpxg4b7y93g_EeqfGLmLSfmAhsNekfS6Tjocrrgg&oe=6A26DAF9"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-xALf2IJmG0Q7kNvwGuASB-&_nc_oc=AdothOqjxaJgnb7TYT3KC_e-wVAHx5FDNqtlgwz8RkLxIQ1magtFWgWg4yZOU1ONHYQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-lWCVwGho4wMWThEZTo5dgYwIig88NfpO7-BBPhazy3g&oe=6A26EA93"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xJQgtRU1bOQQ7kNvwEOLsuL&_nc_oc=Adq-GeiDjAiobZU6amFM5fOHcMz5xHBTVfgwIo861e5_iIEMLAMGqWjtV8M9jvnFNGQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_jYPS0M1LdeCOfQVC-wGrgzJ0jTRrk86ZHK-YLUB_xvg&oe=6A26BDFB"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eV9UT2_SsMAQ7kNvwGrcq8S&_nc_oc=Adq-DsgIdkh7sBYOjHqPgRrTRFcDtuLtz8VEg0TBw5LJSvo0zxC4lipH9hzubuf3W-Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8NE4o-sb6RqHV8RiKfRA_H8zGko8Rnv8ujAYSk618p4A&oe=6A26BF4A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WemGcXr5BVgQ7kNvwEzkwW1&_nc_oc=AdpVVOIJTZKCTr9oBQQJmJADEhwKXhsbfuL97PcQq7sZ-OTylOujSBl3n8FLnQUacNI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9Yw7L4CxFQN9Pdz02sZcjgSmWFHdw4jlLcybCqxuIkmg&oe=6A26E0BE"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se